      "type": "feature",
      "_id": "mhaCRzlI2DtlqCbx",
      "img": "modules/daggerheart-scifi-content/artwork/icons/abilities/solar-fist.webp",
      "system": {
        "attribution": {},
        "description": "<p>The ship is too large and complex to run efficiently without a moderately sized crew. The dedicated crew can operate the ship independently and fills all crew positions, providing the dedicated effect. When the dedicated crew takes Actions, the GM rolls a <strong>d20 + the vehicle’s Tier</strong> to resolve the action. When the dedicated crew pilots the ship, it has a base <strong>Evasion of 9 + Tier</strong>.</p>",
        "gmNotes": "",
